data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a2", "content": "Found it. Tuesday's send included the **partner-event import list** from July — about 2.4k of those addresses hard-bounced, which dragged the aggregate open rate down and hurt your sender reputation with two inbox providers.\n\nQuarantining that segment and re-warming with your engaged cohort should recover it within two sends."}
